BT /F2 18 Tf 54.00 728.00 Td (HomePlanner Project Report) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 682.00 Td (1. Executive Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 651.00 Td (HomePlanner is a full-stack web application for designing residential floor plans in a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 636.50 Td (browser. The application lets users register, sign in, create projects, draw 2D floor plans,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 622.00 Td (add architectural elements such as walls, doors, double doors, windows, gates, stairs,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 607.50 Td (furniture, and text labels, edit precise properties, and view the same plan in a live 3D) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 593.00 Td (scene.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 570.50 Td (The project demonstrates practical full-stack engineering skills across frontend) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 556.00 Td (development, backend API design, authentication, state management, canvas-based editing, 3D) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 541.50 Td (visualization, persistence, UI/UX design, and deployment readiness.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 519.00 Td (From a job-search perspective, this is stronger than a basic CRUD app because it includes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 496.50 Td (- Real interactive graphics.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 480.00 Td (- Persistent user-owned projects.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 463.50 Td (- Authentication and protected routes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 447.00 Td (- Complex client-side state.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 430.50 Td (- 2D geometry and 3D rendering.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 414.00 Td (- Export, save, undo, redo, keyboard shortcuts, and property editing.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 397.50 Td (- A polished dashboard and authentication experience.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 381.00 Td (- Docker-based local development.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 358.50 Td (This project can be positioned as a portfolio-level product prototype for roles involving) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 344.00 Td (frontend engineering, full-stack engineering, interactive web applications, SaaS tools, or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 329.50 Td (visualization-heavy applications.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 54.00 284.00 Td (2. Problem Statement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 253.00 Td (Many floor-planning tools are either too simple, too expensive, or require installation.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 238.50 Td (HomePlanner solves this by providing a browser-based planning tool where a user can:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 216.00 Td (1. Create an account.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 199.50 Td (2. Manage multiple design projects.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 183.00 Td (3. Draw a floor plan directly in 2D.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 166.50 Td (4. Add construction elements and furniture.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 150.00 Td (5. Edit exact properties.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 133.50 Td (6. View the result in 3D.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 68.00 117.00 Td (7. Save progress automatically.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 94.50 Td (The main technical challenge is that this is not only a form-based application. The editor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 54.00 80.00 Td (needs to behave like a design tool. It must handle drawing, snapping, dragging, resizing,) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 558.00 28 Td (1) Tj ET
